.git
.github
.claude
# Secrets must never reach the build context: `COPY . .` in the builder stage
# would otherwise copy them into builder layers that persist in the local and
# buildx cache. Patterns are anchored to the context root unless prefixed with
# **/ — the old root-only ".env*" missed docker/.env, where the TrueNAS compose
# tells operators to put SECRET_KEY/DB_PASS.
**/.env
**/.env.*
.onscreen-deploy.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/keystore.properties
**/local.properties
docker/certs/
*.exe
bin/
dist/
coverage.out
coverage.html
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
web/.svelte-kit/
internal/webui/dist/
docs/
*.md
!README.md
!LICENSE
# Not used by any image build (clients ship separately; installer/.cache holds
# downloaded third-party binaries; screenshots/testdata are docs/tests only).
clients/
installer/
screenshots/
testdata/
qa-media/
